  "duration": 71.5999984741211,
  "text": "VenueBot isn't a chatbot and it isn't just another CRM. It's a complete enquiry-to-booking system built specifically for wedding venues. Everything is organised around three connected modules, Studio AI, Convert and Care. Studio AI helps you generate more enquiries by analysing your website, benchmarking competitors, identifying conversion gaps and showing exactly where opportunities are being lost. Convert helps you turn more enquiries into tours, responding instantly, nurturing couples automatically, answering questions day and night and making sure no enquiry goes cold. Care gives your team one place to run the entire venue operation. Conversations, bookings, automations, reporting, marketing and AI-powered assistance. Generate more enquiries, convert more couples, manage everything in one place. That's VenueBot and this is how it works.",
